    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d101-a2">

                <pb facs="0163" n="103" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg103"/>

                <head>No. 2.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Translation from the Post Och Inrikes
                        Tidningar, <placeName>Stockholm</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1868-08-24">August 24, 1868</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>In the Aftonbladet, August 18, 1868, it is stated that the United States minister
                    at Stockholm called the attention of his government to the necessity of
                    assisting Russia in acquiring a port in Norway. According to what we learn, from
                    good source, this statement is without foundation.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
